usiness_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"FyDQ8QKKjmBKagZ2GhNb8Q","review_id":"ZZtf4qSRIxgubVokTO8QRQ","date":"2020-09-06T04:16:01","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9409656524658203,"text_excerpt":"such a great coffee place. my first time having stumptown was in new york, so when i stumbled upon this one in the ace a few years ago i was ecstatic. the coffee is excellent, and the atmosphere is unreal. i love thats it's in the ace because that's definitely my favorite hotel in nola"},{"business_id":"FyDQ8QKKjmBKagZ2GhNb8Q","review_id":"uBetu1uTmiQmjvYUP2KTjQ","date":"2018-12-08T19:57:24","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9328657984733582,"text_excerpt":"I usually try to keep my pennies pinched for food and new restaurants, but I had a serious need for a mocha latte today. So I decided to give Stumptown coffee a try. There was quite a line when I arrived so I knew it must've been worth a wait. And it did not disappoint. [Plus, their coffee is direct trade. Meaning they buy directly from the roasters.] Props to the friendly barista who had to deal with me fumbling over my order precaffeine. The atmosphere was posh but laid back and relaxed. Very soothing and clean. There were three rooms to sit to enjoy your coffee and a two small tables outside. You can also bring your cup [&baked goods] to the lobby of Ace Hotel as well I'm sure which is..."},{"business_id":"FyDQ8QKKjmBKagZ2GhNb8Q","review_id":"14koJR0xr38kc8DXP9w1ow","date":"2016-07-16T22:20:10","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9326611161231995,"text_excerpt":"I LOVE Stumptown's iced coffee, and when I heard they were opening an iced coffee-centric location in New Orleans, I was stoked. It definitely did not disappoint. The service was extremely friendly and helpful, and because I got there not too long before closing, they threw in an extra scone when I bought a croissant. The croissant was great, and the scone was a savory scone, almost like a cheesy garlic biscuit. I highly recommend it. There's also a great atmosphere, as well as a way to buy a big growler of their iced coffee. Tempting, to say the least! It was happy hour at the Ace Hotel bar when I arrived (near closing) so it was really loud and there was no place to sit. I bet if I went..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"FyDQ8QKKjmBKagZ2GhNb8Q","photo_id":"_tV6yE4FgdkZQrXfpmvbjw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/_tV6yE4FgdkZQrXfpmvbjw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8972710371017456},{"business_id":"FyDQ8QKKjmBKagZ2GhNb8Q","photo_id":"LMQNTg6kDOW0RVNuQgnXgQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/LMQNTg6kDOW0RVNuQgnXgQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8851321339607239},{"business_id":"FyDQ8QKKjmBKagZ2GhNb8Q","photo_id":"2sHkGQMLgYQpX7w3B_CWsQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/2sHkGQMLgYQpX7w3B_CWsQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8508746027946472},{"business_id":"FyDQ8QKKjmBKagZ2GhNb8Q","photo_id":"LvA9auLgUw-Ta7UOZhO4lQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/LvA9auLgUw-Ta7UOZhO4lQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.842938244342804},{"business_id":"FyDQ8QKKjmBKagZ2GhNb8Q","photo_id":"GA5zmkLB6TDTLdeI9kvwYA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/GA5zmkLB6TDTLdeI9kvwYA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.837113618850708}]},"notebook_case":null}
